                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game and Exapunks are directly reponsible for me having a career. I learned to love programming from these games, and I was fortunate to be in a position to turn that into a job. It's not an \"oh years later I eventually...\" thing. I spent a solid month playing Exapunks, and then said \"yeah people will pay me to do this, I should look into that\". Within 6 months I was writing C++ full time.\n\nSo thank you Zachtronics, thank you for teaching me to love parallelized assembly programming.",
